ily:宋体\">时</span>30<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">分；</span></span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">2<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、定标候选人签到及集合等候地点：东莞市公共资源交易中心开标室（</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">7</span></span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）；</span></span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">3<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、定标前答辩会议时间：</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">07</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">月</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">08</span></span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">日</span>9<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">时</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">30</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">分；</span></span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">4<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、定标前答辩会议地点：东莞市公共资源交易中心开标室（</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">8</span></span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）；</span></span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">特别提醒：</span></span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">1<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、定标候选人应派出拟在本项目任职的项目负责人（总监理工程师）</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">人携带有效身份证件原件及法定代表人授权委托书</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\">（</span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">格式详见招标文件第</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\">十</span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">章</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\">投标文件格式</span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">“</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">授权委托书或法定代表人身份证明</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">”</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\">）</span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">原件参加答辩，项目负责人（总监理工程师）答辩时应采用</span>PPT<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">方式汇报（以</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">U</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">盘方式提交，为防止数据丢失或</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">U</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">盘故障，建议另行携带一个备用</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">U</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">盘。由于定标候选人携带的</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">U</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">盘无法读取或文件无法正常打开，后果由定标候选人自行承担）。</span></span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">2<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、答辩人员应着正装出席，保持礼貌态度，答辩结束后需等待评委示意方可离场。</span></span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">3<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、签到后需保管通讯工具（手机、电子手表）等，届时请调为静音或关机状态。</span></span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">4<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、请答辩人员携带上述资料按时到达答辩签到地点，由于资料不全或迟到的，视为放弃答辩的权利。</span></span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px\">5<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、其他答辩要求请详见本项目招标文件。</span></span></p><p><br/></p>", "method": "", "region": "广东", "buyer": "", "deadline": "", "budget": "", "attachments": [{"url": "https://www.gdzwfw.gov.cn/ggzy-portal/base/sys-file/download/v3/ff847844-b3b6-41f4-9fe4-9662174c4ca9?1819241", "name": "答辩补充通知.pdf", "ext": "pdf", "size": ""}], "hasAttachment": true, "is_bidding": true}